            "review_text": "Peter M\nMount Barker, Australia4 contributions\n0\nAmazing range, amazing food\nJun 2019 • Friends\nWe make a point of visiting this restaurant each time we are in Vietnam and to say the food is awesome is an understatement. Last time we visited with some friends that usually eat dead animals, they ordered crispy fried duck and said it tasted better than the real thing. Great restaurant, visit, you won't be disappointed. If food of this quality was available everywhere the whole world would be vegetarian.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 30, 2019",
